### Test d'inscription - Particulier (User)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jean.dupont@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "user",
  "firstName": "Jean",
  "lastName": "Dupont",
  "phoneNumber": "+33612345678",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-15",
  "driverLicenseNumber": "123456789"
}

### Test d'inscription - Entreprise (Promoter)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "contact@agence-voyage.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "promoter",
  "name": "Agence Voyage Aventure",
  "companyName": "Agence Voyage Aventure",
  "companyType": "Agence événementielle",
  "contactEmail": "contact@agence-voyage.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+33612345678",
  "companyAddress": "123 Avenue des Voyages, Paris"
}

### Test de connexion
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jean.dupont@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Test de récupération du profil (nécessite un token)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN_ICI

### Test de mot de passe oublié
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jean.dupont@example.com"
}

### Test de vérification d'email
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/send-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jean.dupont@example.com"
}

### Test de vérification avec code OTP
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jean.dupont@example.com",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Test de réinitialisation de mot de passe
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jean.dupont@example.com",
  "code": "123456",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}

### Récupérer tous les utilisateurs
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### Récupérer un utilisateur par ID
GET http://localhost:3000/users/VOTRE_USER_ID
